en:
{col1}WARNING!{white}
This trapdoor leads to your {col2}Doom{white}.

Are you sure you wish to enter?

{white}You can speak to people by {col1}typing words{white}
or clicking {col1}%1{white} to use the current {col1}Cloud Word{white}.
Once a word is in the input box, press {col1}Enter{white} or {col1}%2{white} to say it.
Some words are {col1}hidden{white} and require typing in fully, by hand!
{col2}(Note: if using a mouse, an icon at the bottom-right opens a virtual keyboard){white}

